			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 4360
			},
			"text": "一个绸密模型,每个token都要跑完所有参数。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:04,360",
				"to": "00:00:10,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 4360,
				"to": 10960
			},
			"text": "但有个办法,让6710亿参数的模型,每个token只算370亿。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,960",
				"to": "00:00:12,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10960,
				"to": 12960
			},
			"text": "它就是混合专家。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,960",
				"to": "00:00:17,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12960,
				"to": 17040
			},
			"text": "阶段期,第11课,Mixure of Experts."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,040",
				"to": "00:00:20,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17040,
				"to": 20680
			},
			"text": "2026年的前沿模型,几乎全是梦。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:20,680",
				"to": "00:00:24,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 20680,
				"to": 24320
			},
			"text": "西书,是这10年最重要的扩展思路。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,320",
				"to": "00:00:28,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24320,
				"to": 28640
			},
			"text": "绸密Transformer的推理算力,等于参数量乘2。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:28,640",
				"to": "00:00:32,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 28640,
				"to": 32640
			},
			"text": "把模型做大,每个token就负全额账单。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:32,640",
				"to": "00:00:36,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 32640,
				"to": 36320
			},
			"text": "到2024年,前沿撞上了这堵墙。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:36,320",
				"to": "00:00:41,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 36320,
				"to": 41120
			},
			"text": "做法很简单,把每个F5N换成一个独立专家。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,120",
				"to": "00:00:45,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41120,
				"to": 45200
			},
			"text": "再加一个路由器,为每个token挑K个专家。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:45,200",
				"to": "00:00:48,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 45200,
				"to": 48560
			},
			"text": "总参数随一掌,算力只随K掌。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,560",
				"to": "00:00:53,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48560,
				"to": 53840
			},
			"text": "路由器就是一个线性层,给每个token对每个专家打分。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,840",
				"to": "00:00:57,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53840,
				"to": 57760
			},
			"text": "取分数最高的K个,就是被激活的专家。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:57,760",
				"to": "00:01:03,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 57760,
				"to": 63280
			},
			"text": "Deep Seek V3的配置,是256个专家,每个token选8个。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:03,280",
				"to": "00:01:08,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 63280,
				"to": 68480
			},
			"text": "选中的专家各算一遍,输出按门控权,重加全球合。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:08,480",
				"to": "00:01:13,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 68480,
				"to": 73840
			},
			"text": "门控权,重视原始分数的softmax,不是加偏制之后的。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:13,840",
				"to": "00:01:17,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 73840,
				"to": 77200
			},
			"text": "这一点很关键,讲均衡时会用到。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:17,200",
				"to": "00:01:22,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 77200,
				"to": 82960
			},
			"text": "如果路由器把9成token,都送进专家3,其他专家就饿死了。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:22,960",
				"to": "00:01:29,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 82960,
				"to": 89040
			},
			"text": "早期用辅助损失法使用率方差,多一个超参和第二个T度信号。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,040",
				"to": "00:01:34,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89040,
				"to": 94720
			},
			"text": "Switch Transformer还用容量丢弃,一出的token直接跳过这一层。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:34,720",
				"to": "00:01:39,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 94720,
				"to": 99840
			},
			"text": "Deep Seek V3换了个思路,给每个专家加一个学道的偏制。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:39,840",
				"to": "00:01:43,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 99840,
				"to": 103440
			},
			"text": "偏制只影响选择,不影响门控权重。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:43,440",
				"to": "00:01:48,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 103440,
				"to": 108640
			},
			"text": "每部训练后,按使用率推正负,把路由和表达结偶了。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:48,640",
				"to": "00:01:53,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 108640,
				"to": 113040
			},
			"text": "跑一千个token,目标是每个专家250个。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:53,040",
				"to": "00:01:58,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 113040,
				"to": 118480
			},
			"text": "不加偏制时,使用率在206-301之间乱跳。"
