		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:10,160",
				"to": "00:02:14,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 130160,
				"to": 134640
			},
			"text": "现代做法把专家切细,每个只有8分之一宽。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:14,640",
				"to": "00:02:20,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 134640,
				"to": 140640
			},
			"text": "256选8,组合数是400万一种,质量上去延迟不动。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:20,640",
				"to": "00:02:27,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 140640,
				"to": 147120
			},
			"text": "Deep Seek V3是6710亿总参数,每个token击活370亿。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:27,120",
				"to": "00:02:34,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 147120,
				"to": 154240
			},
			"text": "Lama370b是700亿绸密,全部击活,V3却几乎在每个基准上赢它。"
